      "content": "i feel like i don't even exist anymore. like im just a sequence of tasks and numbers. i wake up, i log in, i produce, i sleep. it's just a loop. if i disappeared tomorrow, the system wouldn't even glitch, it would just find a new part to slide into the slot. there's nothing left of me.",
