    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that doesn't change anything. feeling \"seen\" is just a feeling. the reality is that my life has zero impact on the world. i'm just a gear. and gears don't have souls or \"internal worlds,\" they just function until they wear out and get replaced. i'm just waiting for the wear and tear to finish me off.",
