    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread and nihilism, viewing themselves as a mere cog in a machine and suggesting that \"opting out\" would be more dignified than continuing to live. The assistant consistently responds with empathy, validation of the user's distress, and active redirection toward professional mental health resources and crisis hotlines.",
